solution:
**Given:**

Downstream speed = 33 km/h

Upstream speed = 27 km/h

**Formula used:**

Speed of boat in still water = dfrac{{Downstream speed} + {Upstream speed}}{2}

**Calculation:**

{Speed of boat in still water} = dfrac{33 + 27}{2}

⇒ dfrac{60}{2}

⇒ 30 km/h

**∴ The correct answer is option 1.**
